  "steps": [
   "Cook the onion and garlic in the oil for 5 minutes. Add the tomato and cook 8 minutes.",
   "Add the sardines, peas, palm hearts, olives, water and salt and bring to the boil.",
   "Add the cornmeal gradually, stirring, and cook 5 minutes until it pulls away.",
   "Decorate the base of a ring mould with egg, parsley and sardine. Pack in the mixture.",
   "Cool 30 minutes and turn out."
